    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BARRY AUCTIONEERS & VALUERS are thrilled to bring to the market this stunning 3-Bedroom A-Rated Semi-Detached Home with west facing garden in Belview Wood, Maryborough Ridge, Douglas, Cork.\r\n\r\nPresented in show-house condition, this exceptional three-bedroom semi-detached residence extends to approximately 119 sq. m. and offers a superb combination of contemporary design, generous proportions and energy-efficient living as well as under floor heating on the ground floor.\r\nLocated within The Green at Belview Wood, Maryborough Ridge, the property enjoys a highly desirable setting in Douglas and has been meticulously maintained and beautifully presented throughout, allowing the new owners to simply turn the key and move in.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is bright, spacious and thoughtfully laid out for modern family life. The ground floor offers generous living and entertaining space, complemented by a stylish contemporary finish, while upstairs there are three well-proportioned bedrooms and excellent family accommodation.\r\n\r\nA particularly attractive feature is the west-facing rear garden, which benefits from afternoon and evening sunshine and provides an ideal setting for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply relaxing at the end of the day.\r\n\r\nThe property’s A energy rating delivers the comfort and efficiency expected from a modern home, while its impressive 119 sq. m. floor area provides an excellent sense of space throughout.\r\n\r\nSituated in the sought-after Maryborough area of Douglas, the property combines a peaceful residential setting with convenient access to Douglas Village, schools, shops, amenities and Cork City.\r\n\r\nKey features include: A-rated energy-efficient home; approximately 119 sq. m.; three bedrooms; semi-detached design; highly desirable west-facing rear garden; immaculate show-house condition; contemporary, turnkey presentation.\r\n\r\nA beautifully presented, energy-efficient family home in one of Douglas’s most desirable modern developments,  early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Living Room: - 6.0m x 3.7m \r\n Porcelain tiles, windows to the front with plantation shutters, French doors to rear garden.\r\n\r\nKitchen / dining room: - 6.0m x 3.2m \r\n 90 X 90 Porcelain tiled floor, fully fitted modern kitchen with integrated oven, hob, extractor, microwave, dishwasher and fridge freezer. There is a window to the front with plantation shutters and also window with blind overlooking rear garden. \r\n\r\nUtility room: - 2.9m x 1.8m \r\nTiled floor, built in units and washing machine & dryer.\nStore room: Storage area\r\n\r\nGuest wc: - \r\nWc & whb, tiled floor and feature mirror.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 / Ensuite - 6.0m x 3.7m \r\nLaminate floor, Built in slider robes , panelling on the wall, window to the front with blind.// Ensuite:: 3 piece suite with feature mirror and tiled floor and partially on the wall.\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: - 4.2m x 3.1m \r\nLaminate flooring, Window to front with blind, walk in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.0m x 3.0m \r\nLaminate flooring with built in wardrobe, window with blind overlooking front of property.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom: - \r\n3 piece suite with feature mirror and tiled floor.\n\r\n\r\nOutside: - \r\n 2 designated spaces, enclosed west facing rear garden.\r\n\r\n"
      },
